t has dented the  tiniest bit  however the screen did not shatter I've  had service products in the past where  I've accidentally dropped them or  knocked them and the screen has  absolutely shattered into a million  pieces  thankfully hand on heart this one did  not break and it was fantastic news for  me because the screen replacements are  about $1000 and that's not something you  want to pay when you've already spent  $3,000 one laptop moving forward after  you've set up this laptop and you're  using it on day to day basis you're  actually going to be pleasantly  surprised by the fast load time it  incorporates a brand new windows face  recognition software and unlike any  other computer I've used in the past  including other surface devices it's  actually lightning fast now this is  something that's gonna please you  diehard gamers  out there the keyboard on this product  is actually incredible for something  with a very sleek modern design it  actually has quite a lot of travel in  the keys you're going to notice that you  can hear the keys typing away something  that a lot of people have been  complaining about this product here on  the internet on YouTube in particular is  actually the screen brightness however I  haven't had any issues with this product  I've used it all around the world in  different lighting situations in bright  lights like in the studio and even  outside in direct sunlight I haven't had  an issue to date unlike in the past  where I've owned the generic surfaces  themselves with the little flippy flimsy  keyboard their screens are actually  incredibly hard to deal with in the  harsh sunlight conditions there was one  day where I was sitting next to my  partner on my surface and she had her  macbook out and it was night and day she  could see everything perfectly clear and  I was really struggling to see my  content on the computer okay so this is  a feature which may or may not interest  you personally to me it made absolutely  no difference what the speakers sound  like on this machine however if you're a  video editor in 2019 chances are you  might want the speakers to be crisp and  clear when you don't have your  headphones laying around and you're  doing some video editing on the fly now  pulled up one of my old videos here and  set the volume for about 50% I maybe I  made out a meter and half away from the  camera and I'm going to hold it from  this distance and again closer to the  camera so you guys can get a clearer  understanding of what the speakers are  like how powerful they are and how clear  they are what's going on guys my name is  anna scott mitchen welcome back to the  channel and they have it the speakers in  this device actually quite good from a  little small device that weighs less  than a MacBook Air it is actually  incredible what they've been able to  produce the sound does kind of seem to  come through the keys as there isn't too  many open holes and ports on the device  but that isn't a deal-breaker at all one  fault that I had found in this laptop  and with actually most new products on  the market is the fact that gets very  hot very quickly especially when running  programs like Premiere Pro or Photoshop  or even after  one thing that did surprise me is it  gets very hot and very loud when casting  over your chromecast so when you're  streaming a movie on YouTube on to your  TV for some reason the computer can't  really handle it the programs don't talk  well to each other and the fan just  keeps on to maximum straight away I did  a test the other day and streamed a 40  minute video from my laptop to micro  class in the living room and the battery  dropped from a hundred percent down to  76 percent that's 24 percent in 40  minutes  now considering this laptop is meant to  have a 14 and a half hour battery time  24 percent in 40 minutes is very  disappointing how about a general  day-to-day basis I did get about 6 or 7  hours out of this laptop without having  to worry a